{%- comment -%}
  Shop policies — refund, shipping, terms of service and privacy.

  A Liquid template rather than JSON: `policy` is not one of the template types
  Shopify accepts as JSON, and a policy.json is rejected on upload while every
  other file in the same push lands. The symptom is a page that silently keeps
  rendering the old way, which is exactly how this was found.

  Section settings therefore come from the schema defaults in main-policy.liquid
  rather than from a template file, and the merchant edits them in the theme
  editor. Company details are not repeated here — the footer publishes the name,
  address and phone on every page of the site already.
{%- endcomment -%}
